    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "An herb drying hanger is three small "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "loop pockets",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "loop-pocket"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in DK cotton threaded onto a 40 cm wooden dowel. Each pocket is a flat double crochet strip folded and stitched into a tube: a bunch of fresh herbs tied at the stem is tucked in upside down, then the pocket folds back over to hold it. Hang the dowel from a hook in a warm, ventilated kitchen."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
